<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 17.20 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tues.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 17.20 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 17.20 million rand worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after selling a net 128.74 million rand on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27</p>
</text>
